      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROTHWELL BONNIE (7) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 460m behind Room To Breathe (26.42) in a Grade 4/5. Placed at her previous run. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Can discover winning form. MR. BLUEY LEE (3) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to score two back then came home strongly into second (25.95) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Warrnambool last time. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Comes through a solid form race last start. Leading player again. BIG DUKE (2) has missed the frame at his last two but did run well three back when second (25.86) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SNITCH ADAMS (1) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
